<title>POLAND: PETROBANK AUG NET RISES TO PLN 0.6 MLN.</title>
<headline>PETROBANK AUG NET RISES TO PLN 0.6 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results August</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit					  0.64 vs    0.48</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    0.77 vs    0.88</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		  2.86 vs    2.49</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	 5.39 vs    4.51</p>
<p>JANUARY-AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit					  4.58 vs    7.45</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    7.44 vs   10.61</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 20.44 vs   22.58</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	43.06 vs   34.91</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Petrobank SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
